  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">We are seeking approval confirmation for the budget allocation covering project-funded roles, including the TEFOS Programme Manager, TEFOS Delivery Officer, and Forest and Land Use Officer. Additionally, we request approval for travel and hospitality expenses for the programme management team, which are necessary to lead the TEFOS Programme.</narrative>
